      <p class="story__text" data-i18n="story.2.text.0">
        After troubleshooting and listing potential causes, I implemented changes to the measurement setup and acquisition process on the system level.
      </p>
      <p class="story__text" data-i18n="story.2.text.1">
        The deviations significantly reduced after the changes, and the work provided a clearer path for future sound measurement troubleshooting.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

